"of the FONTESIN business model and franchise infrastructure across Central "
"Europe and beyond."
msgstr ""
"Supervisa la excelencia operativa y la estrategia de implementación de la "
"plataforma. Co-arquitecto del modelo de negocio de FONTESIN y de la "
"infraestructura de franquicias en Europa Central y más allá."

#: phase8 templates/website/career.html
msgctxt "website"
msgid ""
"Own the infrastructure, CI/CD pipelines, monitoring, and deployment of the "
"FONTESIN platform across multiple regions. Ensure high availability and "
"security compliance."
msgstr ""
"Sea propietario de la infraestructura, los canales de CI/CD, el monitoreo y "
"la implementación de la plataforma FONTESIN en múltiples regiones. Garantice"
" la alta disponibilidad y el cumplimiento de la seguridad."

#: phase8 templates/website/career.html
msgctxt "website"
msgid ""
"Own the product roadmap for the core platform including company "
"registration, certification, licensing, and the world map module. Work "
"directly with engineering and the founding team."
msgstr ""
