"confiabilidad. Cada interacción en FONTESIN está respaldada por datos "
"verificados y procesos auditables."

#: phase8 templates/website/career.html
msgctxt "website"
msgid ""
"We are actively hiring across engineering, product, business development, "
"and regional operations. All positions are remote-friendly."
msgstr ""
"Estamos contratando activamente en ingeniería, productos, desarrollo "
"comercial y operaciones regionales. Todas las posiciones son remotas."

#: phase8 templates/website/career.html
msgctxt "website"
msgid ""
"We are always looking for exceptional people. Send us your profile and tell "
"us how you can contribute to the FONTESIN mission."
msgstr ""
"Siempre estamos buscando personas excepcionales. Envíanos tu perfil y "
"cuéntanos cómo puedes contribuir a la misión de FONTESIN."

#: phase8 templates/website/index.html
msgctxt "website"
msgid ""
"We are building a global micro-community of 200 visionaries, experts, and "
"pioneers shaping the future of digital business collaboration."
msgstr ""
"Estamos construyendo una microcomunidad global de 200 visionarios, expertos "
"y pioneros que dan forma al futuro de la colaboración empresarial digital."

#: phase8 templates/website/about.html
msgctxt "website"
msgid ""
"We are building the global infrastructure for trusted business "
"communication, certification, and collaboration — without borders."
msgstr ""
"Estamos construyendo la infraestructura global para una comunicación, "
"certificación y colaboración empresarial confiable, sin fronteras."

#: phase8 templates/website/about.html
msgctxt "website"
msgid ""
"We are currently in our Pre-MVP phase, onboarding pioneer members, franchise"
" partners, and regional coordinators who will shape the foundation of the "
"platform."
msgstr ""
"Actualmente nos encontramos en nuestra fase Pre-MVP, incorporando miembros "
"pioneros, socios de franquicia y coordinadores regionales que darán forma a "
"las bases de la plataforma."

#: phase8 templates/website/career.html
msgctxt "website"
msgid ""
"We are looking for a senior backend engineer to build and maintain the core "
"API infrastructure of the FONTESIN platform. You will work on tenant-"
"isolated data architecture, billing integrations, and real-time data "
"ingestion pipelines."
msgstr ""
"Buscamos un ingeniero backend senior para construir y mantener la "
"infraestructura API central de la plataforma FONTESIN. Trabajará en la "
"arquitectura de datos aislados de inquilinos, integraciones de facturación y"
" canalizaciones de ingesta de datos en tiempo real."

#: phase8 templates/website/career.html
msgctxt "website"
msgid ""
"We are not looking for employees — we are looking for partners. Join the "
"team building the global infrastructure for trusted business collaboration."
msgstr ""
"No buscamos empleados, buscamos socios. Únase al equipo que construye la "
"infraestructura global para una colaboración empresarial confiable."

